    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/0db3b0e7a9945855ad4c8c877b6be501.avif?t=1744968411\" data-has-big width=800 height=219 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game tells a captivating story of a 19-year-old young man named Tyler, who has had an unshakable passion for motorsports since childhood.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/ba9d9008464c860efdea39eba921e19e.avif?t=1744968411\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll encounter the mafia, detective investigations, and the mysterious death of your father. It's up to you to uncover whether an Italian family is involved and what secrets the criminal underworld is hiding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/3f6c2780cce0ea30c903d85e65eae29e.avif?t=1744968411\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Heals</strong> offers you a thrilling relationship experience. Will you find your one true love, or choose to date multiple women and enjoy the variety? The choice is yours!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/8e5c211674b244b389bf402438fc65ca.avif?t=1744968411\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a world of mystery, love, and danger. You'll face the mafia, investigate enigmatic events, and uncover how an Italian family is connected to the tragedy of your life. Will you be able to stay true to yourself amid this whirlwind of events?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505640/extras/3b3234a65f98871ebc0907a82c277d5a.avif?t=1744968411\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
